# CLAUDE.md
Read IMPLEMENTATION.md in full before any work. It is the sole specification.

Rules:
- Follow §0 ground rules exactly. Never ask the owner a question.
- Track state in docs/PROGRESS.md: current increment, acceptance status,
  blocked H-tasks. Update it before ending any session.
- One increment at a time. Do not start INC-N+1 until INC-N acceptance
  criteria pass, except increments marked ∥.
- Commit at every passing acceptance criterion with message "INC-N: <what>".
- Secrets come from .env — never hardcode, never commit.